{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33589","headline":"成纪书事二首 二 · 许棠","name":"成纪书事二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹉跎远入犬羊中，荏苒将成白首翁。\n三楚田园归未得，五原岐路去无穷。\n天垂大野鵰盘草，月落孤城角啸风。\n难问开元向前事，依稀犹认隗嚣宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}